#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QSlider, contrastSlider)
#. +> trunk
#: src/part/dialog.ui:267
msgid "Here you can vary the contrast of the filemap in realtime."
msgstr "Hier lett sik in Echttiet de Kontrast för de Infografik ännern."

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, varyLabelFontSizes)
#. +> trunk
#: src/part/dialog.ui:291
msgid "The font size of exploded labels can be varied relative to the depth of the directories they represent. This helps you spot the important labels more easily. Set a sensible minimum font size."
msgstr "De Schriftgrött för ruttrocken Textfeller laat sik in Afhangigkeit to ehr Vertekendeepde ännern un so wichtig Beteken eenfacher finnen. Legg de Minimaalschriftgrött mit Bedacht fast."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, varyLabelFontSizes)
#. +> trunk
#: src/part/dialog.ui:294
msgid "Var&y label font sizes"
msgstr "Textfeld-Schriftgrötten ä&nnern"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, useAntialiasing)
#. +> trunk
#: src/part/dialog.ui:301
msgid "Anti-aliasing the filemap makes it clearer and prettier, unfortunately it also makes rendering very slow."
msgstr "Mit Kantstreken warrt de Infografik klorer un mojer, man langsamer dorstellt."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, useAntialiasing)
#. +> trunk
#: src/part/dialog.ui:304
msgid "&Use anti-aliasing"
msgstr "&Kantstreken (\"Anti-Aliasing\") bruken"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, showSmallFiles)
#. +> trunk
#: src/part/dialog.ui:311
msgid "Some files are too small to be rendered on the filemap. Selecting this option makes these files visible by merging them all into a single \"multi-segment\"."
msgstr "En poor Dateien laat sik op de Infografik nich dorstellen, wiel se to lütt sünd. Disse Optschoon faat se all na een \"Multisegment\" tohoop, so dat se sik liekers dorstellen laat."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, showSmallFiles)
#. +> trunk
#: src/part/dialog.ui:314
msgid "Show small files"
msgstr "Lütte Dateien wiesen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel2)
#. +> trunk
#: src/part/dialog.ui:351
msgid "The smallest font size Filelight can use to render labels."
msgstr "De lüttst Schriftgrött för't Dorstellen vun Textfeller"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel2)
#. +> trunk
#: src/part/dialog.ui:354
msgid "Minimum font si&ze:"
msgstr "Minimaal&schriftgrött:"

